{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01962","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 暗牖悬蛛网 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 暗牖悬蛛网","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暗中蛛网织，历乱绮窗前。\n万里终无信，一条徒自悬。\n分从珠露滴，愁见隙风牵。\n妾意何聊赖，看看剧断弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}